<title>JAPAN: JAPAN MOF LIKELY TO OFFER 3-MO T-BILLS NEXT WEEK.</title>
<headline>JAPAN MOF LIKELY TO OFFER 3-MO T-BILLS NEXT WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) is likely to offer three-month treasury bills (T-bills) later next week, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The offer is expected to roll over the 173rd issue of three-month T-bills, which amounts to 1.5 trillion yen and will mature on August 20.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8806</p>
</text>
